                                                "sense_id": "59315c76-ef9d-378d-94e4-d2ff916cc079",
                                                "text": "[A]nd to show that there was no shortage of steam, Royal Scot, directly we stopped, blew off vigorously from its safety-valves steam that well might have been used in the cylinders in the interest of timekeeping."
                                            }
                                        ]
